|: Bm / | !G_2 !A_2 :|x2

vs 2
|: Bm / | ^"BACK TO TOP" !G_2 !A_2 :|x4

ch 4
|: Bm / | !G_2 !A_2 | Bm / | Em_2 F#m_2 :|x2

[Solo Over Chorus] 4
|: Bm / | !G_2 !A_2 | Bm / | Em_2 F#m_2 :|x2

